/**
 * Working code in 18 languages, for the things people actually look up.
 *
 * Snippets are stored as plain strings with escaped newlines so that the whole
 * table stays greppable and diff-friendly, and so no snippet can accidentally
 * close a template literal.
 *
 * Every snippet here is short on purpose: it is a reminder of the syntax, not a
 * tutorial. A brain with no model cannot write novel code, and pretending
 * otherwise would be the one thing this app refuses to do.
 */

